1
00:00:03,051 --> 00:00:07,082
Safe inside Curio, Noah and Mila watch the storm.

2
00:00:07,132 --> 00:00:07,915
Lightning…

3
00:00:07,965 --> 00:00:11,164
and three seconds later, BOOM, thunder!

4
00:00:11,214 --> 00:00:12,213
Why so late?

5
00:00:12,991 --> 00:00:14,315
Mila counts every time…

6
00:00:14,365 --> 00:00:16,644
sometimes three seconds, sometimes ten!

7
00:00:16,694 --> 00:00:17,839
It's as if the noise

8
00:00:17,889 --> 00:00:19,382
were dawdling on the way…

9
00:00:20,172 --> 00:00:21,686
Discovery mission!

10
00:00:24,202 --> 00:00:24,746
Mini mode!

11
00:00:24,796 --> 00:00:28,019
Lightning is burning hot, it heats the air all at once,

12
00:00:28,069 --> 00:00:29,208
hotter than the Sun!

13
00:00:29,258 --> 00:00:31,648
So the air swells so fast that it cracks…

14
00:00:31,698 --> 00:00:32,590
that's thunder!

15
00:00:33,362 --> 00:00:34,592
They leave together,

16
00:00:34,642 --> 00:00:37,343
but the light zooms and arrives right away.

17
00:00:37,393 --> 00:00:41,054
Sound, much slower, moves three hundred meters per second…

18
00:00:41,104 --> 00:00:42,319
so it arrives late!

19
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:43,575
So count!

20
00:00:43,625 --> 00:00:47,363
If there are three seconds between the lightning and the thunder,

21
00:00:47,413 --> 00:00:49,228
the storm is one kilometer away.

22
00:00:49,278 --> 00:00:50,161
And six seconds…

23
00:00:50,211 --> 00:00:51,085
two kilometers!

24
00:00:51,862 --> 00:00:53,399
Noah counts fifteen seconds,

25
00:00:53,449 --> 00:00:56,346
so the storm is five kilometers away and moving off.

26
00:00:56,396 --> 00:00:58,103
But as long as we hear thunder,

27
00:00:58,153 --> 00:00:59,003
we stay inside!

28
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:02,542
And that's why thunder comes after lightning.

29
00:01:03,405 --> 00:01:06,170
The light of the lightning arrives right away;

30
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:08,791
the sound of thunder takes time to travel.

31
00:01:09,552 --> 00:01:11,356
With an adult, behind the window:

32
00:01:11,406 --> 00:01:14,614
as soon as you see the lightning, count until the thunder…

33
00:01:14,664 --> 00:01:16,405
three seconds is one kilometer!

34
00:01:17,550 --> 00:01:19,827
And how does a magnet attract metal?

35
00:01:19,877 --> 00:01:21,170
The answer tomorrow.
